      "reasoning_content": "Now I understand the input format. Let me write the solution.py that:\n1. Reads the CSV file from sys.argv[1]\n2. Parses the header and data rows\n3. Normalizes item names by collapsing whitespace and casefolding\n4. Skips rows with empty normalized names\n5. Handles blank quantities (default to 1)\n6. Merges rows with same normalized name by summing quantities\n7. Outputs JSON array sorted by normalized item name\n",
